<!--
THESIS: 住宅建筑样板册，让真实窗景先于界面出现，拒绝卡片堆叠的装修模板。
OWN-WORLD: 冷白纸面、深绿触控、陶土橙标线、整版住宅摄影与材料色板。
STORY: 用户先看清可施工改造，再上传照片、选择方案并预约量尺。
FIRST VIEWPORT: 方幅窗景占主位，左侧三行标题，双入口贴住图片下沿，信任说明露出。
FORM: 建筑杂志式首页，批准稿 .impeccable/mocks/home-composition/approved-user-reference.png。
CONCEPT-SEED: 用户直接指定并批准 attached-reference 路径；无 concept-seed 脚本 key。
FINISH: unreviewed and undocumented is unfinished; this build ends with the finish review, the verdict, DESIGN.md, and every shipping raster carrying its provenance
-->
<view class="home-page">
  <view class="home-header">
    <view class="home-header__spacer"></view>
    <view class="home-header__title">门窗效果预览</view>
    <view class="home-header__service">支持上门量尺</view>
  </view>

  <view class="hero">
    <image class="hero__image" src="/assets/generated/home-hero-mobile.jpg" mode="aspectFill" />
    <view class="hero__copy">
      <view class="hero__title"><text>换窗之前，</text><text>先看清装进</text><text>家里的样子</text></view>
      <view class="hero__accent"></view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="experience-panel">
    <button class="primary-button experience-panel__main" bindtap="goUpload">上传照片看效果</button>
    <button class="secondary-button experience-panel__sample" bindtap="trySample"><text>没有照片？</text><text>先用客厅样例体验</text></button>
  </view>

  <view class="trust-strip">
    <view class="trust-item"><text class="trust-item__value">只替换门窗</text><text class="trust-item__label">不改变墙体与结构</text></view>
    <view class="trust-item"><text class="trust-item__value">方案可施工</text><text class="trust-item__label">基于真实产品配置</text></view>
    <view class="trust-item"><text class="trust-item__value">满意再预约</text><text class="trust-item__label">预览满意后再推进</text></view>
  </view>

  <view class="home-section home-section--needs">
    <view class="section-heading">
      <view class="section-heading__title">你最想改善什么？</view>
      <text class="section-link" bindtap="goSolutions">按需求选方案</text>
    </view>
    <view class="need-grid">
      <view class="need-item pressable" bindtap="goSolutions"><view class="need-item__mark need-icon need-icon--air"><view></view><view></view><view></view></view><text class="need-item__name">通风舒适</text><text class="need-item__detail">改善闷热与空气流通</text></view>
      <view class="need-item pressable" bindtap="goSolutions"><view class="need-item__mark need-icon need-icon--sound"><view class="sound-core"></view><view class="sound-wave sound-wave--one"></view><view class="sound-wave sound-wave--two"></view></view><text class="need-item__name">隔音降噪</text><text class="need-item__detail">降低外界噪音干扰</text></view>
      <view class="need-item pressable" bindtap="goSolutions"><view class="need-item__mark need-icon need-icon--light"><view class="light-core"></view><view class="light-ray light-ray--h"></view><view class="light-ray light-ray--v"></view></view><text class="need-item__name">采光明亮</text><text class="need-item__detail">提升室内自然光线</text></view>
      <view class="need-item pressable" bindtap="goSolutions"><view class="need-item__mark need-icon need-icon--safe"><view class="safe-shield"><view class="safe-lock"></view></view></view><text class="need-item__name">安全安心</text><text class="need-item__detail">增强居家防护能力</text></view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="home-section home-section--solutions">
    <view class="section-heading">
      <view class="section-heading__title">门窗方案演示</view>
      <text class="section-link" bindtap="goSolutions">查看全部</text>
    </view>
    <scroll-view class="solution-scroll" scroll-x enhanced show-scrollbar="{{false}}">
      <view class="solution-scroll__track">
        <view wx:for="{{featuredSolutions}}" wx:key="id" wx:for-item="solution" class="solution-scroll__item">
          <solution-card solution="{{solution}}" compact bind:select="onSolutionSelect" />
        </view>
      </view>
    </scroll-view>
  </view>

  <view class="service-footer">
    <view class="demo-badge">页面住宅图片均为生成的演示素材</view>
    <view class="service-footer__text">效果仅供方案沟通参考，尺寸、价格与施工方式以上门量尺为准。</view>
  </view>
</view>
